      "value": "The Wanderers have left traces of themselves across the entire galaxy - many or most have been lost to time or salvage, but you may encounter them in your travels. Most, sadly, will scoff at you and call you a liar. Few believe anything predates the Ancients, after all. Yet, if that were not the case, explain our history?"
